n  lang=EN-US style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>:-<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n  <\/td>\r\n  <td width=408 colspan=3 valign=top style='width:306.0pt;padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt'>\r\n  <p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>TRANSASIA\r\n  BIO-MEDICAL LTD <\/span><\/p>\r\n  <\/td>\r\n <\/tr>\r\n <tr>\r\n  <td width=105 valign=top style='width:78.75pt;padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt'>\r\n  <p class=MsoNormal><b><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:\r\n  \"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>Kit Used<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n  <\/td>\r\n  <td width=31 colspan=2 valign=top style='width:23.25pt;padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt'>\r\n  <p class=MsoNormal align=center style='text-align:center'><b><span\r\n  lang=EN-US style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>:-<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n  <\/td>\r\n  <td width=408 colspan=3 valign=top style='width:306.0pt;padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt'>\r\n  <p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>ERBA\r\n  XL SYSTEM PACKS<\/span><\/p>\r\n  <\/td>\r\n <\/tr>\r\n <tr>\r\n  <td width=105 valign=top style='width:78.75pt;padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt'>\r\n  <p class=MsoNormal><b><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:\r\n  \"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>BATCH NO.<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n  <\/td>\r\n  <td width=31 colspan=2 valign=top style='width:23.25pt;padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt'>\r\n  <p class=MsoNormal align=center style='text-align:center'><b><span\r\n  lang=EN-US style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>:-<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n  <\/td>\r\n  <td width=408 colspan=3 valign=top style='width:306.0pt;padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt'>\r\n  <p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>S012236<\/span><\/p>\r\n  <\/td>\r\n <\/tr>\r\n <tr height=0>\r\n  <td width=105 style='border:none'><\/td>\r\n  <td width=15 style='border:none'><\/td>\r\n  <td width=16 style='border:none'><\/td>\r\n  <td width=48 style='border:none'><\/td>\r\n  <td width=59 style='border:none'><\/td>\r\n  <td width=301 style='border:none'><\/td>\r\n <\/tr>\r\n<\/table>\r\n\r\n<\/div>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><b><span lang=EN-US\r\nstyle='font-size:9.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>NOTE:<\/span><\/b><span\r\nlang=EN-US style='font-size:9.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>\r\nC-reactive protein (CRP) is one of the acute phase proteins being synthesised\r\nby hepatocytes. The serum concentration of the CRP increases during acute\r\nstages of diverse disease associated with inflammation and tissue injury.\r\nElevated CRP has been demonstrated in nearly all bacterial and fungal\r\ninfection. In addition, it has been shown to be increased in other disease as neoplasia,\r\nand rheumatic disease as well as in major surgery. The diagnosis usefulness of\r\nCRP is based on the velocity and on the magnitude of its increase. Serum\r\nconcentrations are raised with in hours of disease onset and the increase can\r\nbe as much 2000-fold. A rapid fall of CRP levels indicate recovery. \u00a0<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><b><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\r\n\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><b><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:\r\n\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>*VALUES RECHECKED<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><b><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:\r\n\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>DRAWN SAMPLE FROM OUTSIDE<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><b><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:\r\n\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>Test Done By: \u2013 Fully Automated Clinical Chemistry\r\nAnalyzer. (EM 200)<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<\/div>","page":{"size":"595.45pt 841.7pt","margin":"151.2pt 36.0pt 72.0pt 36.0pt"}}